    May 5 - Falcon Avenue 708, 131 -138' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'A reception centre is open today for re-entry package and cleaning kit pickup.' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'The ESS reception centre is at New Horizon, 8 Bonneau Rd. and will be open from 9 a.m. to 4:30 p.m., to hand out re-entry information packages and Red Cross cleaning kits, while supplies last.' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'The package contains information on first re-entry steps, how to clean your home, where to dispose sandbags, and more. [env, pssg, embc, tnf]','Evacuation order in wake of flooding at Parker Cove now lifted','Internet',1,1,0,null,to_date('25-MAY-23','DD-MON-RR'),to_date('25-MAY-23','DD-MON-RR'),null,null,null,'column','Castanet','Castanet',null,null,'SyndEnclosureImpl.length=119837' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'SyndEnclosureImpl.interface=interface com.sun.syndication.feed.synd.SyndEnclosure' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'SyndEnclosureImpl.type=image/jpeg' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'SyndEnclosureImpl.url=https://www.castanet.net/content/2023/5/349306735_653134669982094_8129675012888014914_n_p3689468.jpg',0,0,null,to_date('01-JAN-70','DD-MON-RR'),null,null,'https://www.castanet.net/news/Vernon/428542/Evacuation-order-in-wake-of-flooding-at-Parker-Cove-now-lifted',0,null,0,0,null,0,0,0,0,'rfreeman',0,0,0,null,0,0,0,0,null,null,null);
