    NO YARD/GARDEN WATERING BETWEEN 10AM AND 7PM ANY DAY (Including drip irrigation)' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'The restrictions apply to all domestic customers - residential, commercial, and industrial. Customers using a watering can or hose with spring-loaded nozzle may hand water anytime.' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'Agricultural customers may continue to water within their allocation to maintain the health of their crops but are being asked to conserve wherever possible.' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'They must also adhere to a maximum flow rate of 0.78 litres per second per hectare as excessive use can cause neighbours to lose water pressure.' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'Meanwhile, Greater Vernon Water is in the design phase of installing filtration at the Mission Hill Water Treatment Plant, which will remove the turbidity and greatly assist in avoiding this situation in the future. [maz, env]','Water restrictions begin for Vernon as demand challenges system','Internet',1,1,0,null,to_date('18-MAY-23','DD-MON-RR'),to_date('18-MAY-23','DD-MON-RR'),null,null,null,'column','Castanet','Castanet',null,null,'SyndEnclosureImpl.length=109852' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'SyndEnclosureImpl.interface=interface com.sun.syndication.feed.synd.SyndEnclosure' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'SyndEnclosureImpl.type=image/jpeg' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'SyndEnclosureImpl.url=https://www.castanet.net/content/2023/5/irrigation-2402568_960_720._p3540493_p3589483_p3687564.jpg',0,0,null,to_date('01-JAN-70','DD-MON-RR'),null,null,'https://www.castanet.net/news/Vernon/427423/Water-restrictions-begin-for-Vernon-as-demand-challenges-system',0,null,0,0,null,0,0,0,0,'rfreeman',0,0,0,null,0,0,0,0,null,null,null);
