    Individuals involved in an archery competition/practice hosted by a recognized and organized group or archery club meeting the standards set by the Federation of Canadian Archers for safety.' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || '"Regulations regarding the use of a longbow or crossbow for hunting vary throughout many communities in BC and may largely depend on community layout, population density and community social and ethical acceptance," the report says.' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || '"Adjacent communities including Kelowna, Salmon Arm and Armstrong, have no local government legislation that refer to use of longbows or crossbows for hunting within municipal boundaries and rely on Provincial Wildlife Act and Regulations for compliance and enforcement."','City of Vernon staff provide information on who can use longbow, crossbow in the city','Internet',1,1,0,null,to_date('21-MAY-23','DD-MON-RR'),to_date('21-MAY-23','DD-MON-RR'),null,null,null,'column','Castanet','Castanet',null,null,'SyndEnclosureImpl.length=58548' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'SyndEnclosureImpl.interface=interface com.sun.syndication.feed.synd.SyndEnclosure' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'SyndEnclosureImpl.type=image/jpeg' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'SyndEnclosureImpl.url=https://www.castanet.net/content/2023/5/screen_shot_2023-05-20_at_9.02.34_am_p3688272.jpg',0,0,null,to_date('01-JAN-70','DD-MON-RR'),null,null,'https://www.castanet.net/news/Vernon/427790/City-of-Vernon-staff-provide-information-on-who-can-use-longbow-crossbow-in-the-city',0,null,0,0,null,0,0,0,0,'calmazan',0,0,0,null,0,0,0,0,null,null,null);
