    Extending south to Highway 29N, from the intersection of Highway 97N to Bear Flats.' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'An evacuation order remains in place covering more than 60 homes in the region, and residents have been advised to evacuate the area immediately to Fort St. John to access Emergency Support Services.' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'The Boundary Lake fire is also burning near Fort St. John over an area more than 60 square kilometres.' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || '- With files from The Canadian Press' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || '[forr, embc, pssg, maz]','Evacuation alert area expanded for Red Creek wildfire in BC''s Peace River region','Internet',1,1,0,null,to_date('13-MAY-23','DD-MON-RR'),to_date('13-MAY-23','DD-MON-RR'),null,null,null,'SyndCategoryImpl.taxonomyUri=null SyndCategoryImpl.name=News/Canada/British Columbia ','CBC Online','CBC Online',null,null,null,0,0,null,to_date('01-JAN-70','DD-MON-RR'),null,null,'https://www.cbc.ca/news/canada/british-columbia/bc-wildfire-may-13-2023-1.6842627?cmp=rss',0,null,0,0,null,0,0,0,0,'calmazan',0,0,0,null,0,0,0,0,null,null,null);
Human Rights Commissioner seeks input from community organizations - BC News
Don Urquhart - May 24, 2023 / 8:09 am ' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || ' Story: 428312' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'Photo: The Canadian Press' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'B.C. Human Rights Commissioner Kasari Govender speaks in Vancouver, on Tuesday, March 7, 2023. Govender is calling a recent court decision for a workplace discrimination case involving the mother of a young child "a significant win for gender equality." THE CANADIAN PRESS/Darryl Dyck' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'BC''s Human Rights Commissioner is calling for "critical voices" from community organizations in the Interior to participate in its baseline survey as poverty and housing emerge as the top issues.' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'Early responses from over 400 organizations that have so far responded to the Commissioner''s "Baseline" survey saw over a fifth citing either housing and shelter (12 per cent) or adequate income and poverty (8 per cent) as one of their top three human rights concerns.' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || '"We have already received hundreds of responses, but we are missing critical voices from the Thompson-Okanagan, Cariboo, Kootenays, North Coast, Northeast and Nechako," said Commissioner Kasari Govender.' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'The commissioner emphasized that responses from anywhere in BC were welcome but urged organizations in these regions to take the survey to ensure their voices are represented.' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || '"It is critical we hear from organizations in all regions of the province. Hearing from a wide range of organizations across BC will better allow us to understand human rights issues and evaluate progress. It will help direct our efforts to influence policy and raise public awareness, and help us to deepen relationships across BC to enhance capacity and build strength," she said.' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'Those who have responded so far include frontline workers (36 per cent), non-frontline workers' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || '(15 per cent), management (19 per cent), executive leadership (14 per cent) and volunteers (9 per cent).','Human Rights Commissioner seeks input from community organizations','Internet',1,1,0,null,to_date('24-MAY-23','DD-MON-RR'),to_date('24-MAY-23','DD-MON-RR'),null,null,null,'column','Castanet','Castanet',null,null,'SyndEnclosureImpl.length=26497' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'SyndEnclosureImpl.interface=interface com.sun.syndication.feed.synd.SyndEnclosure' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'SyndEnclosureImpl.type=image/jpeg' || CHR(13) || CHR(10) || 'SyndEnclosureImpl.url=https://www.castanet.net/content/2023/5/20230424130436-abd102afa7ef53bbf59301235f5efe7d38e4fe354b2f9746bea320941e3ce530_p3679611._p3689096.jpg',0,0,null,to_date('01-JAN-70','DD-MON-RR'),null,null,'https://www.castanet.net/news/BC/428312/Human-Rights-Commissioner-seeks-input-from-community-organizations',0,null,0,0,null,0,0,0,0,'rdrain',0,0,0,null,0,0,0,0,null,null,null);
